    ],
    "text": "I, do hereby make amendment in the Sinhala text announcement related to the By-Law relating to Parking Hiring Cars andMotor Vehicles of Ganga Ihala Korale Pradeshiya Sabha, published in the Section IV(a) of Extraordinary GazetteNo. 1877/32 and dated 28.08.2014 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka.",
