    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      492.13,
      540.0,
      588.16
    ],
    "text": "I, Sarath Ekanayake, as the Miniser in Charge of the subject of Local Government of the Central ProvincialCouncil, do hereby notify according to the powers vested in me under Sub-section (1) of Section 123 of the PradeshiyaSabha Act, No. 15 of 1987, to be read with Sub-section (1)(a) of Section 2 of the Provincial Council Act (ConsequentialProvisions) No. 12 of 1989, has approved the following By-Laws framed by the Ganaga Ihala Korale Pradeshiya Sabha,according to powers vested under paragraph (e), Sub-section (VII) of Section 126 of the said Act, to be read with Sub-section (1) of Section 122 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of 1987, and the said By-Laws shall be effective within thePradeshiya Sabha authority area of Ganga Ihala Korale from the date of publication of this notification in the Government",
